================================================================================
Provenance of the MPQ reader
================================================================================

The archive reader descends from a chain of ports, each permissively licensed:

    mpyq      -- Aku Kotkavuo         (Python)
      -> mpyqjs            -- Farof
      -> empeeku           -- nexus-devtools
      -> @heroesbrowser/mpq -- Myrddraall (this library's 2018 incarnation)
      -> @myrddraall/mpq    -- this package

Algorithm details also follow StormLib (Ladislav Zezula), the reference C++
MPQ implementation, which is BSD-licensed. No StormLib code is included; it is
cited in comments where its behaviour defines the correct result.
